---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<Base
  title="About Solano Towing | Local 24/7 Dispatch in Fairfield, CA"
  description="Solano Towing is a local 24/7 towing dispatch serving Fairfield, Suisun City, Vacaville and the Cordelia Junction with licensed independent operators."
  path="/about/"
>
  <section class="s-ink">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who answers when you call</p>
      <h1>Local dispatch, local trucks</h1>
      <p style="max-width:42em; margin-top:1em;">
        Solano Towing exists because of a gap every local driver has hit: it's 1am, you're on the
        I-80 shoulder near the Cordelia Junction, and half the numbers you call ring to voicemail.
        We run a single 24/7 dispatch line for Fairfield, Suisun City, Vacaville, and the
        surrounding corridor, and route every job to licensed, insured independent operators based
        right here in Solano County.
      </p>
      <p style="max-width:42em;">
        We are not a national call center, and we don't route your job to whichever truck bids
        lowest three counties away. The operators we work with drive this corridor daily, know the
        difference between the Green Valley exit and Suisun Valley Road, and quote one firm price
        before they roll.
      </p>
      <p style="max-width:42em;">{SITE.legalLine}</p>
      <a class="btn-call" href={`tel:${SITE.phone}`}>Call {SITE.phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="s-ink">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our standard</p>
      <ul class="spec">
        <li><strong>Answered 24/7</strong><span>A person, not a voicemail box, at any hour.</span></li>
        <li><strong>One firm price</strong><span>Quoted before dispatch. The number on the phone is the number on the receipt.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Licensed & insured operators</strong><span>Every truck in the network carries commercial coverage.</span></li>
        <li><strong>Local only</strong><span>Solano County trucks for Solano County calls.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
